{"product_id":"stirling-moss-all-my-races","title":"Stirling Moss: All My Races","description":"\u003cp\u003ePublished to mark the 80th birthday of Sir Stirling Moss OBE, this important book tells the story of each of the 529 races in which he took part, from the start of his racing life in 1947 to his career-ending crash at Goodwood in 1962. Told in Sir Stirling’s own words, this book is packed with detail and anecdote, supported by a wealth of photographs – many previously unpublished – that show all the greatest moments and the extraordinary variety of cars he drove. This will be a book to treasure.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 235 x 286\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Stirling Moss OBE | Alan Henry\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781844257003\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45868070600857,"sku":"17RC-3-9781844257003","price":40.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690dbd352703b_Stirling_Moss_All_My_Racess.jpg?v=1762514897","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/stirling-moss-all-my-races","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}